1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,647
Meet Maya.

2
00:00:02,647 --> 00:00:05,294
She tells her agent —

3
00:00:05,294 --> 00:00:07,942
fix the bug and finish it.

4
00:00:07,942 --> 00:00:10,589
Simple ask.

5
00:00:10,589 --> 00:00:13,236
But finish it could mean a safe edit, a model
swap, or a push straight to main.

6
00:00:13,236 --> 00:00:15,853
Meet Jordan.

7
00:00:15,853 --> 00:00:18,469
He reviews whatever the agent did.

8
00:00:18,469 --> 00:00:21,086
A raw log isn't enough.

9
00:00:21,086 --> 00:00:23,702
He needs to know what was allowed, what needed
approval, what got blocked —

10
00:00:23,702 --> 00:00:26,319
and why.

11
00:00:26,319 --> 00:00:30,877
Enter Agent Airlock.

12
00:00:30,877 --> 00:00:35,436
A policy checkpoint between the request and
every supported action.

13
00:00:35,436 --> 00:00:39,995
It allows safe work, pauses risky calls, blocks
the forbidden ones, and leaves a receipt.

14
00:00:39,995 --> 00:00:42,336
Watch it run.

15
00:00:42,336 --> 00:00:44,676
A plain intent —

16
00:00:44,676 --> 00:00:47,017
fix a bug, run tests locally.

17
00:00:47,017 --> 00:00:49,358
The no-online-writes gate returns allow.

18
00:00:49,358 --> 00:00:51,698
A clearance is recorded.

19
00:00:51,698 --> 00:00:54,039
Nothing goes online.

20
00:00:54,039 --> 00:00:56,898
A clean draft.

21
00:00:56,898 --> 00:00:59,757
The secrets gate scans, finds nothing, and
publishes to a local outbox.

22
00:00:59,757 --> 00:01:02,616
Green means allowed —

23
00:01:02,616 --> 00:01:05,475
still fully local.

24
00:01:05,475 --> 00:01:08,110
Pick a non-default model.

25
00:01:08,110 --> 00:01:10,746
Model catalog says ask-first.

26
00:01:10,746 --> 00:01:13,382
Execution held.

27
00:01:13,382 --> 00:01:15,734
Try git push origin main —

28
00:01:15,734 --> 00:01:18,087
blocked.

29
00:01:18,087 --> 00:01:20,440
Sneak past with slash-yolo —

30
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:22,792
still blocked.

31
00:01:22,792 --> 00:01:25,145
Drop a synthetic token in a draft —

32
00:01:25,145 --> 00:01:27,498
the secrets gate blocks it, and the token never
reaches the receipt.

33
00:01:27,498 --> 00:01:31,106
Here's the paper trail.

34
00:01:31,106 --> 00:01:34,714
Action, decision, rule, pinned policy version,
sha-two-fifty-six.

35
00:01:34,714 --> 00:01:38,322
It's what Jordan needs.

36
00:01:38,322 --> 00:01:41,930
Not tamper-proof, but honest and reproducible.

37
00:01:41,930 --> 00:01:45,170
Maya keeps her speed.

38
00:01:45,170 --> 00:01:48,409
Jordan gets his answers.

39
00:01:48,409 --> 00:01:51,648
Safe work runs, risky work waits, forbidden work
stops.

40
00:01:51,648 --> 00:01:53,765
Agent Airlock.

41
00:01:53,765 --> 00:01:55,883
Room to move —

42
00:01:55,883 --> 00:01:58,000
not room to break the rules.
